  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow in the infocmp -i option\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-69720.patch: in analyze_string() in\n       progs/infocmp.c, clamp the copy length taken from strlen(cp) to\n       MAX_TERMINFO_LENGTH and grow buf2 by one byte for the terminating\n       NUL, so an over-long capability string can no longer overflow the\n       fixed-size stack buffer.\n     - CVE-2025-69720",
